{"t":"Dankwart","s":"dankwart-44948","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Dankwart</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSvargrond\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145837&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32202,31162,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32202, 31162, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Barkeeper</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.00<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20220313175341&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dankwart_95e565.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Dankwart.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Come to my tavern if you're hungry or thirsty, traveller.</li><li>You'll never taste such fine mead and tea like here in this tavern.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>West in <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>, in the tavern Tempest in a Meadhorn.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Dankwart runs the tavern Tempest in a Meadhorn.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not buy anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\"><img alt=\"Bread\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bread_df8535.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">Bread</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\"><img alt=\"Cheese\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cheese_fd71d6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">6 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\"><img alt=\"Ham\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ham_25e33a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\"><img alt=\"Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\"><img alt=\"Mug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Dankwart.</i></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General_keywords\">General keywords</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dankwart</strong>: Hi there and welcome to my tavern. Have a drink.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>drink</b><br/>\nDankwart: Are you looking for a drink? I have tea and hot mead. Our mead is a little less stronger than the original barbarian mead though, else we'd have a bunch of tourists pass out here each day.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mead</b><br/>\nDankwart: Yes, just ask me for a trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>news</b><br/>\nDankwart: I assume our town gossip would only bore a traveller like you.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nDankwart: The king probably laughs about <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>'s failure here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Queen</b><br/>\nDankwart: The queen should really spend more resources on the Svargrond operations.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nDankwart: I am Dankwart. A rather unusual name at this place but my ancestors came here from <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nDankwart: I am a tavern keeper. Well at least you would call it like that. Actually I am just responsible for the common hall.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>gods</b><br/>\nDankwart: I learned only little about the gods.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras\">Ferumbras</a></b><br/>\nDankwart: Some regulars shared stories about this evil sorcerer. It is said that he resurfaced somewhere in the South.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Excalibug</b><br/>\nDankwart: That is some mighty weapon that got lost in a war or so.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>offer</b><br/>\nDankwart: I can offer you bread, cheese, ham, or meat as well as {drinks}. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Food</b><br/>\nDankwart: Are you looking for food? I have bread, cheese, ham, and meat. Just ask me for a trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>how are you?</b><br/>\nDankwart: I am fine, thank you.</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dankwart</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Svargrond\">Svargrond</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Barbarians\">barbarians</a></b><br/>\nDankwart: The barbarians are not as bad as foreigners might think. It is mainly the bad behaviour of the raiders that cause their bad reputation.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>raiders</b><br/>\nDankwart: They are nothing more than mislead people. It's a sad thing that they became that hostile to Svargrond.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>cults</b><br/>\nDankwart: Several people passed our city. They were quite reclusive. It seemed as if others followed them even without passing our city at all ...<br/>\nDankwart: I am not sure if they belonged to some sort of cult but they behaved more than suspiciously.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>druids</b><br/>\nDankwart: The druids are still working on intensifying the bonds with the shamans.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>shamans</b><br/>\nDankwart: They are spiritual guides and seers.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>jarl</b><br/>\nDankwart: The jarl is a wise man.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mines</b><br/>\nDankwart: The mines were lost many years ago. I doubt that we get them back any time soon.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Chyll</b><br/>\nDankwart: My family converted to the faith of the barbarians to some extent. If you live here long enough, you know from the north wind that there is some force at work here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a></b><br/>\nDankwart: Most of the shamans live on the isle Nibelor.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Everspring</b><br/>\nDankwart: That is the place of afterlife. Shamans can tell you more about it.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>years of serpents</b><br/>\nDankwart: They were the reason that my people stranded here. However, my ancestors were not too sorry about it and adapted quite well.</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dankwart</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Cities\">Cities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a></b><br/>\nDankwart: The town is somewhat rough but it has its charms.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></b><br/>\nDankwart: Edron must be wonderful and idyllic.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a></b><br/>\nDankwart: Carlin will probably put more efforts into improving relations with Svargrond soon.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></b><br/>\nDankwart: Venore will surely try to hinder Carlin in any way.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></b><br/>\nDankwart: Thais has little interest in this area.</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dankwart</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Races_and_monsters\">Races and monsters</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>dragons</b><br/>\nDankwart: There are travellers who will assure you that some dragons exist here in this cold climate. Some even claim that an own breed of ice dragons lives on these isles.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>dwarfs</b><br/>\nDankwart: The dwarfs that came here were able to drink like a true barbarian.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>elf</b><br/>\nDankwart: We rarely see an elf here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>chakoyas</b><br/>\nDankwart: The chakoyas are a true threat. Luckily, they are not too many and they rarely dare to come close to Svargrond.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Yeti\">yeti</a></b><br/>\nDankwart: I don't know if they are real or just some figure of tavern tales.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nDankwart: Good bye.</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dankwart</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>","quests":["barbarian-test-quest","the-travelling-trader-quest"],"pos":{"x":32202,"y":31162,"z":7}}